{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:10.60.630","page_type":"section"},"citation":"10.60.630","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.630","content_hash":"3ed94edd8ae98538e5fd2711037494748e712377bab74236f467331433a2582e","heading":"Unauthorized removal of vehicle or device prohibited.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.630:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.630","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to move or attempt to move any vehicle that has an immobilization device attached thereto, except as authorized by a police officer or a parking control officer.\n(b) It shall be unlawful for any person to tamper with an immobilization device or remove or attempt to remove an immobilization device placed thereon by a parking control officer or police officer.\n(c) Any person violating this section may be punished by:\n(1) A fine of not more than $499.00;\n(2) Imprisonment in jail for not more than 179 days; or\n(3) Both such fine and imprisonment not to exceed the limits set out in subsection (c)(1) and (c)(2) of this section. (Ord. 19589 § 3, 6-14-11.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"4018a4f7-2635-53bb-ae45-44dbe2b881d2"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.630","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.630","content_hash":"58783f1e3c00f779360035deef9c4e58101319ca94188d0fbe3cc24b67f86e57","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.630:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.630:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.630","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to move or attempt to move any vehicle that has an immobilization device attached thereto, except as authorized by a police officer or a parking control officer.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"269ead9a-55e1-5542-969d-4606372297e0"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.630","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.630","content_hash":"3e8e369fa99543223d59f688175cd86d881c19b9dc7a034241fc77ba08502491","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.630:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.630:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.630","text":"(b) It shall be unlawful for any person to tamper with an immobilization device or remove or attempt to remove an immobilization device placed thereon by a parking control officer or police officer.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"59a864a2-a8ba-5b21-a397-57c504937620"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.630","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.630","content_hash":"91bf82f3361ef95b80c2896862615333c613dc1787f9ee229d1c90dfc2535bac","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.630:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.630:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.630","text":"(c) Any person violating this section may be punished by:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"a2ed8e6d-faf6-50c5-affe-f9857e16d4b4"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.630","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.630","content_hash":"c698bb7e4b668e5c9c83a76b40cd0dcf6985459c1f1db4d86db9a7a1356bb119","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1